[I] C++ wrapper for libupnp

[T] libupnpp is a C++ library that defines useful objects over
[T] libupnp/libnpupnp for creating both UPnP devices and control points. It
[T] is shared by the upmpdcli media renderer and the upplay control point.

[U] https://framagit.org/medoc92/libupnpp

[A] Libupnpp Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

